{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19101490","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19101490","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910149001:0":{"text":"What's all this...?","source_cn":"两位客人，这些是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FC8B82B6DFCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910149002:0":{"text":"不关<style=stress><player_nam...","source_cn":"不关<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910149003:0":{"text":"你们要是不爽，就罚咱一个人，要骂要打，还是要把咱赶走，...","source_cn":"你们要是不爽，就罚咱一个人，要骂要打，还是要把咱赶走，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910149004:1":{"text":"反正别找<male>他</male><female>她...","source_cn":"反正别找<male>他</male><female>她...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910149005:1":{"text":"嗯……你说什么？啊，我想起来了，是你白天说的“陆地分配...","source_cn":"嗯……你说什么？啊，我想起来了，是你白天说的“陆地分配...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910149006:1":{"text":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","source_cn":"哎呀，真抱歉，我差点把这件事给忘了……本来还想多问你们...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910149007:1":{"text":"Morin, here's what happened...","source_cn":"沫霖姐姐，是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EEB7A34BD81DB5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1910149008:1":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"no_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910149009:1":{"text":"I see. So that's how people on the surface live. It really is quite different from our ways.","source_cn":"原来这是陆地的习惯，和海裔有很大差异呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FAC8881E723945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910149010:1":{"text":"I get it. I'll talk to Grandma in the morning, and we'll go on another hunt.","source_cn":"我知道了，明天早上我和阿嬷说一声，我们再出去围猎一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA4996C461C73FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910149011:1":{"text":"Uh-huh! Well, if that's all, we'll let you get some sleep. Goodnight!","source_cn":"嗯！既然没什么事，那我们先告辞了，你们也早点休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA898DEE84CDA836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910149012:1":{"text":"...Hey, wait! Y-You're just leaving?!","source_cn":"……喂，等一下！你……你们就这么走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628FFF9944C12728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910149013:1":{"text":"嗯？需要我们帮忙整理这些资源吗？","source_cn":"嗯？需要我们帮忙整理这些资源吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB0FE356BBF25F605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910149014:1":{"text":"That's not what I mean!","source_cn":"咱不是说这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD71799AF991F532","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910149015:1":{"text":"You... You're not angry? Don't you wanna yell at me or something?!","source_cn":"你们……难道就不生气？不想骂咱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE623678445ACDC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910149016:1":{"text":"But you're our friend! Why would we be angry with you?","source_cn":"你们是我的朋友呀，我为什么要生气，要骂你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5850604891C0E205","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910149017:1":{"text":"你拿走那些资源是因为你需要它，既然需要，那当然应该给你们啊。","source_cn":"你拿走那些资源是因为你需要它，既然需要，那当然应该给你们啊。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8D524B41F5FCC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910149018:1":{"text":"でも……","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C657A67EEF9A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910149019:1":{"text":"Get some sleep... *Yawn*... Goodnight!","source_cn":"早点睡吧……呵欠……晚安啦，大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2694E7B9FD82E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910149020:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1910149020":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910149021:1":{"text":"I don't get it. Why aren't they furious?","source_cn":"咱不明白，为什么她们不生气？","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0xB7D9770231761F05","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"I don't get it. Why aren't they furious?","female":"I don't get it. Why aren't they furious?","variant_male_record_index":"254310","variant_female_record_index":"254311","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910149022:1":{"text":"要是在卡什澜，咱干了这种事，一定会被老头子追着满村打，...","source_cn":"要是在卡什澜，咱干了这种事，一定会被老头子追着满村打，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910149023:1":{"text":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","source_cn":"她们……怎么就不生气呢？！","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0x9A606BD519CAEA6E","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","female":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","variant_male_record_index":"254314","variant_female_record_index":"254315","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1910149023":{"text":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","source_cn":"她们……怎么就不生气呢？！","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0x9A606BD519CAEA6E","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","female":"So why... why aren't they angry?!","variant_male_record_index":"254314","variant_female_record_index":"254315","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910149024:1":{"text":"I know... It's just... I don't know how to explain it.","source_cn":"咱知道。就是感觉……咱说不清。","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0xA5BE2D9D388671E0","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"I know... It's just... I don't know how to explain it.","female":"I know... It's just... I don't know how to explain it.","variant_male_record_index":"254316","variant_female_record_index":"254317","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910149026:1":{"text":"咱就是觉得这儿和家里不一样，老头子天天教训咱，说什么“...","source_cn":"咱就是觉得这儿和家里不一样，老头子天天教训咱，说什么“...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:29:1910149026":{"text":"Things are so different here. My old man keeps drilling it into me about \"strength above all\" and \"never show weakness\", but here... Tch! It's so frustrating!","source_cn":"咱就是觉得这儿和家里不一样，老头子天天教训咱，说什么“能者至上、不犯错误”的，可这里……嘁，烦死了。","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0x91390379496AA440","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"Things are so different here. My old man keeps drilling it into me about \"strength above all\" and \"never show weakness\", but here... Tch! It's so frustrating!","female":"Things are so different here. My old man keeps drilling it into me about \"strength above all\" and \"never show weakness\", but here... Tch! It's so frustrating!","variant_male_record_index":"254320","variant_female_record_index":"254321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910149027:1":{"text":"... Yeah. Okay.","source_cn":"……哦。","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0xEA6F7D2BE09DD701","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"... Yeah. Okay.","female":"... Yeah. Okay.","variant_male_record_index":"254322","variant_female_record_index":"254323","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1910149028:1":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"no_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:29:0:1":{"text":"That's how Maulers think, after all.","source_cn":"蛮血的理念的确如此","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5519932BF462B20C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's how Maulers think, after all.","female":"That's how Maulers think, after all.","variant_male_record_index":"95719","variant_female_record_index":"95720","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:29:1:2":{"text":"You'll get used to it eventually.","source_cn":"你会慢慢适应的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x757B6D850BB6E3A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You'll get used to it eventually.","female":"You'll get used to it eventually.","variant_male_record_index":"95721","variant_female_record_index":"95722","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:29:2:3":{"text":"It's late. Let's get some sleep.","source_cn":"太晚了，先回去睡吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA57FDB56228F357F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's late. Let's get some sleep.","female":"It's late. Let's get some sleep.","variant_male_record_index":"95723","variant_female_record_index":"95724","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"Isn't that a good thing for you?","source_cn":"这对你来说不是好事吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35DC372794BE3C75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Isn't that a good thing for you?","female":"Isn't that a good thing for you?","variant_male_record_index":"95715","variant_female_record_index":"95716","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910149025:1":{"text":"Hey! I don't go looking for beatings! It's just...","source_cn":"喂，咱才不会故意找打！咱就是……","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0xC9FE8CCC81D042E4","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"Hey! I don't go looking for beatings! It's just...","female":"Hey! I don't go looking for beatings! It's just...","variant_male_record_index":"254318","variant_female_record_index":"254319","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:1:2":{"text":"You actually want someone to beat you up?","source_cn":"你就这么盼着被打一顿？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2783B4A23FC42ED9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You actually want someone to beat you up?","female":"You actually want someone to beat you up?","variant_male_record_index":"95717","variant_female_record_index":"95718","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"大丈夫か？","source_cn":"你还好吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD474429F94AE87DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"大丈夫か？","female":"大丈夫？","variant_male_record_index":"273123","variant_female_record_index":"273